[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0021","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4878","title":"FlatnuX CMS 2011 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"FlatnuX CMS 2011 08.09.2 版本的 controlcenter.php 中存在绝对路径遍历漏洞，远程管理员可通过 contents/Files 操作中的 dir 参数传入完整路径名，读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4878"],"sources":["cve","nuclei"],"published":"2012-09-06T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将 FlatnuX CMS 升级到最新版本，或在 controlcenter.php 中对 dir 参数进行严格的路径过滤，禁止包含绝对路径和 .. 目录跳转序列。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T12:48:47Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/111473/Flatnux-CMS-2011-08.09.2-CSRF-XSS-Directory-Traversal.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52846","http://www.vulnerability-lab.com/get_content.php?id=487","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74568"],"poc_urls":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/111473/Flatnux-CMS-2011-08.09.2-CSRF-XSS-Directory-Traversal.html"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0259","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0259.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2865","title":"Google Chrome 换行处理越界读取漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 21.0.1180.89 之前版本的行断行（line-breaking）功能中存在越界读取漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向用户发送特制的 HTML 文档，诱使用户在受影响浏览器中打开，触发越界内存读取，导致浏览器崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞源于对文本换行处理时未正确校验边界，属于 CWE-119 内存缓冲区错误。攻击需用户交互（点击链接），CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。Google 已在 Chrome 21.0.1180.89 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2865"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-08-31T19:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:42:14Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 21.0.1180.89 或更高版本。该版本已修复断行处理中的越界读取漏洞，用户可通过浏览器内置更新功能或访问 google.com/chrome 获取最新版本。如无法立即升级，可考虑使用其他浏览器作为临时替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=121347","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/08/stable-channel-update_30.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-09/msg00030.html","http://osvdb.org/85030","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14866","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2865.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2865","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2865","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2865","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2865","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2865.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2865.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2012-2865.yml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-2865","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c6e457224984003aac7610b750677033fb679879/tracker/CVE/2012/CVE-2012-2865.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0259.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0239","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0239.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1976","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox、Thunderbird 及 SeaMonkey 浏览器中的 nsHTMLSelectElement::SubmitNamesValues 函数存在释放后使用漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页内容，在目标系统浏览网页时触发堆内存损坏，进而执行任意代码或导致应用程序拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Firefox 15.0 及 ESR 10.0.7 之前的所有版本、Thunderbird 15.0 及 ESR 10.0.7 之前的所有版本，以及 SeaMonkey 2.12 之前版本。CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1976"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-08-29T10:56:40Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:43Z","remediation":"建议将 Mozilla Firefox 升级至 15.0 或更高版本，Firefox ESR 升级至 10.0.7 或更高版本；Thunderbird 升级至 15.0 或更高版本，Thunderbird ESR 升级至 10.0.7 或更高版本；SeaMonkey 升级至 2.12 或更高版本。如暂无法升级，可在浏览器安全设置中禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施，并避免访问不受信任的网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-08/msg00028.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-09/msg00011.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-09/msg00014.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1210.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1211.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2553","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2554","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2556","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-58.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55319","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1548-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1548-2","http://www.xerox.com/download/security/security-bulletin/16287-4d6b7b0c81f7b/cert_XRX13-003_v1.0.pdf","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=776213","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16818","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1976.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1976","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1976","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-1976","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1976.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a424b5e505273e5365b7d0be8eebfa24fc1b2b60/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-1976","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/045dd815c5c9edb2f848de9196b8b22db27288ca/2012/CVE-2012-1976.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-1976.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-1976","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2012-1976"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0239.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0238","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0238.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1975","title":"Mozilla Firefox/SeaMonkey/Thunderbird 内存错误引用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"该漏洞是 Mozilla Firefox、SeaMonkey 和 Thunderbird 浏览器中 PresShell::CompleteMove 函数存在的 use-after-free（释放后重用）内存错误引用漏洞。攻击者可通过构造恶意网页内容，在浏览器渲染页面时触发该内存错误引用，导致堆内存损坏，未经身份认证的远程攻击者即可利用该漏洞执行任意代码或造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Firefox 15.0 以下版本、Firefox ESR 10.x 10.0.7 以下版本、Thunderbird 15.0 以下版本、Thunderbird ESR 10.x 10.0.7 以下版本以及 SeaMonkey 2.12 以下版本。当用户使用受影响版本的浏览器访问包含恶意代码的网页时，攻击者可在用户系统上执行任意指令，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重。Mozilla 已在 Firefox 15.0 及 ESR 10.0.7 版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户及时升级浏览器至安全版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1975"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-08-29T10:56:40Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:43Z","remediation":"立即将 Mozilla Firefox 升级至 15.0 或更高版本，Firefox ESR 升级至 10.0.7，Thunderbird 升级至 15.0，Thunderbird ESR 升级至 10.0.7，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.12 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，建议暂时禁用 WebGL 功能（在 about:config 中设置 webgl.disabled 为 true），并避免访问不可信的网页和邮件链接，以降低利用 PresShell::CompleteMove 中 use-after-free 漏洞执行任意代码的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-08/msg00028.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-09/msg00011.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-09/msg00014.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1210.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1211.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2553","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2554","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2556","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-58.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55318","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1548-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1548-2","http://www.xerox.com/download/security/security-bulletin/16287-4d6b7b0c81f7b/cert_XRX13-003_v1.0.pdf","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=777578","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17040","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1975.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1975","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1975","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-1975","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a424b5e505273e5365b7d0be8eebfa24fc1b2b60/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-1975","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1975.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9854c179c024bf1d349f724d8589444858e69aa7/2012/CVE-2012-1975.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-1975.json","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2012-1975","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-1975"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0238.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0237","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0237.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1974","title":"Mozilla Firefox/SeaMonkey/Thunderbird 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox、Thunderbird 及 SeaMonkey 的 gfxTextRun::CanBreakLineBefore 函数中存在释放后使用漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的恶意内容触发该漏洞，导致堆内存损坏，进而执行任意代码或造成应用程序拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Firefox 15.0 之前版本、Firefox ESR 10.0.7 之前版本、Thunderbird 15.0 之前版本、Thunderbird ESR 10.0.7 之前版本以及 SeaMonkey 2.12 之前版本。攻击者通过诱导用户浏览恶意网页或打开恶意邮件即可利用此漏洞，无需任何身份验证且攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1974"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-08-29T10:56:40Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:43Z","remediation":"立即将 Firefox 升级至 15.0 或更高版本，Firefox ESR 升级至 10.0.7 或更高版本，Thunderbird 升级至 15.0 或更高版本，Thunderbird ESR 升级至 10.0.7 或更高版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.12 或更高版本。如暂无法升级，建议暂时禁用 JavaScript 并避免访问未知网站作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-08/msg00028.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-09/msg00011.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-09/msg00014.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1210.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1211.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2553","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2554","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2556","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-58.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55317","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1548-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1548-2","http://www.xerox.com/download/security/security-bulletin/16287-4d6b7b0c81f7b/cert_XRX13-003_v1.0.pdf","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=769303","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17015","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1974.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1974","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1974","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-1974","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a424b5e505273e5365b7d0be8eebfa24fc1b2b60/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-1974","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1974.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c9ca0c7ecb65f7366b1a83938dcd1c80cf9c2d0e/2012/CVE-2012-1974.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-1974.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-1974","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2012-1974"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0237.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0236","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0236.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1973","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox、Firefox ESR、Thunderbird、Thunderbird ESR 及 SeaMonkey 的 nsObjectLoadingContent::LoadObject 函数存在释放后使用（Use-after-free）漏洞，属于 CWE-416 类型的内存破坏缺陷。由于对象加载过程中对已释放内存的引用处理不当，远程攻击者可构造特制的网页或内容，诱导用户通过浏览器、邮件客户端等打开后触发该漏洞，造成堆内存破坏，进而导致拒绝服务或执行任意代码，完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 Firefox 15.0 之前版本、Firefox ESR 10.0.7 之前版本、Thunderbird 15.0 之前版本、Thunderbird ESR 10.0.7 之前版本及 SeaMonkey 2.12 之前版本，攻击无需认证且利用难度较低，CVSS v2 评分高达 10.0，危害严重。Mozilla 已于 2012 年 8 月的安全更新中发布修复，建议用户升级至安全版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1973"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-08-29T10:56:39Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:42Z","remediation":"该漏洞为 Mozilla Firefox、Thunderbird 与 SeaMonkey 中 nsObjectLoadingContent::LoadObject 函数的释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，可导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。建议立即将 Mozilla Firefox 升级到 15.0 及以上版本、Firefox ESR 升级到 10.0.7 及以上版本，Thunderbird 升级到 15.0 及以上版本、Thunderbird ESR 升级到 10.0.7 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 升级到 2.12 及以上版本；可通过官方下载页获取最新安装包替换旧版本，或在受管环境中通过组策略推送升级。如暂时无法升级，可在安全策略层面限制用户仅访问受信任网站，禁止打开来历不明的 HTML 邮件及外部链接，并启用浏览器自动更新功能以便及时获取补丁，同时监控浏览器进程异常崩溃行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-08/msg00028.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-09/msg00011.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-09/msg00014.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1210.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1211.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2553","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2554","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2556","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-58.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55316","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1548-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1548-2","http://www.xerox.com/download/security/security-bulletin/16287-4d6b7b0c81f7b/cert_XRX13-003_v1.0.pdf","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=773207","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17045","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1973.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1973","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1973","