禁用 JavaScript 并安装 NoScript 等扩展阻止不可信脚本执行，以降低 XSS 攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-08/msg00028.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-09/msg00011.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-09/msg00014.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1351.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-59.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55260","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1548-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1548-2","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=756719","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16367","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-1956.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1956.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-1956.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-1956.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1956","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1956","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-1956","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-1956.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a424b5e505273e5365b7d0be8eebfa24fc1b2b60/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-1956","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2012/CVE-2012-1956.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0220.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0208","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4681","title":"Oracle Java SE JRE 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Java SE 7 Update 6及更早版本中的Java运行时环境（JRE）组件存在安全管理器绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页，由特制Java小程序（Applet）利用com.sun.beans.finder.ClassFinder.findClass方法结合forName异常机制访问受限类（如sun.awt.SunToolkit），再通过反射调用getField方法修改私有字段，完全绕过SecurityManager安全限制，实现任意代码执行。该漏洞在2012年8月已被野外利用，影响所有安装了受影响Java版本的浏览器用户，CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重。Oracle官方已在后续更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4681"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-08-28T00:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:45:34Z","remediation":"立即卸载 Java 7 Update 6 及更早版本，升级到 Oracle Java 7 Update 7 或更高版本。如业务必须使用旧版 Java，可在浏览器中禁用 Java Applet 插件，并将 Java 安全级别设置为最高。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.fireeye.com/research/2012/08/zero-day-season-is-not-over-yet.html","http://immunityproducts.blogspot.com/2012/08/java-0day-analysis-cve-2012-4681.html","http://labs.alienvault.com/labs/index.php/2012/new-java-0day-exploited-in-the-wild/","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-09/msg00032.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-10/msg00016.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=135109152819176&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1225.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/51044","http://www.deependresearch.org/2012/08/java-7-vulnerability-analysis.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/alert-cve-2012-4681-1835715.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55213","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-240A.html","https://community.rapid7.com/community/metasploit/blog/2012/08/27/lets-start-the-week-with-a-new-java-0day","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-4681","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20865","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-4681.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/dc7f7d0b488d3b9dd1a87b4deaefb31e5285739d/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Java/Exploit/CVE-2012-4681.yara","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/WinNT/CVE-2012-4681/Exploit_WinNT_CVE-2012-4681_HG.yar","https://github.com/LyleMi/Learn-Web-Hacking/blob/7a42e3252fdcae87663434b1fd54ec89d671bfbe/source/language/java/sandbox.rst","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-4681","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2012/CVE-2012-4681/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-4681.txt","https://github.com/milo2012/pentest_scripts/blob/63691e998ef4ef327b6975b69ad716fdecb80a97/mitm/msf1.rc","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2012-4681.html","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2012/database/CVE-2012-4681/CVE-2012-4681-Armoring-benjholla.md","https://github.com/benjholla/CVE-2012-4681-Armoring","https://github.com/ZH3FENG/PoCs-CVE_2012_4681"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0208.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2012/EXP-AVE-2012-0208.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0248","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0248.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2749","title":"Oracle MySQL Server 排序索引计算拒绝服务漏洞","description":"MySQL 5.1.63 之前版本及 5.5.24 之前版本中存在排序顺序索引计算错误漏洞，远程认证用户可通过构造特定查询触发不正确的索引计算，导致 mysqld 进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 MySQL 5.1.x 和 5.5.x 系列，攻击者需拥有数据库有效账户，利用难度较低，但仅影响服务可用性，不涉及数据泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2749"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-08-17T00:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:42:01Z","remediation":"升级 MySQL 至 5.1.63 及以上版本（5.1.x 分支）或 5.5.24 及以上版本（5.5.x 分支）。如使用 Oracle 官方发行版，通过包管理器更新：yum update mysql-server 或 apt-get upgrade mysql-server。临时缓解措施可在 MySQL 配置中限制连接速率和并发数，降低攻击者利用认证后 DoS 的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.1/en/news-5-1-63.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1462.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0180.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/51309","http://secunia.com/advisories/53372","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201308-06.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:150","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55120","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=833737","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-2749.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2749.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2749","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2749","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-2749.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2749","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a16d95b8338fc08632da5f5e0b198e65598a5a90/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2749","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2749.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2012/CVE-2012-2749.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2012/CVE-2012-2749.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0248.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0100","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1535","title":"Adobe Flash Player 字体解析远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 11.3.300.271之前版本（Windows/Mac）及11.2.202.238之前版本（Linux）中存在未明漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开包含特制SWF内容的Word文档触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞源于字体解析过程中的输入验证缺陷，攻击者利用精心构造的SWF文件可完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞已在2012年8月被野外利用，影响范围广泛，CVSS评分7.8，危害等级高。Adobe官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1535"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-08-15T10:31:40Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:39:42Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 11.3.300.271（Windows/Mac）或 11.2.202.238（Linux）及以上版本。由于 Adobe 已于 2020 年 12 月 31 日正式停止 Flash Player 支持并发布终止生命公告，根本性解决方案是彻底卸载 Flash Player，在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件，并移除所有依赖 Flash 的应用程序。临时缓解措施包括：在组策略中禁用 Flash 执行权限，使用企业级白名单软件阻止 SWF 文件运行，以及通过杀毒软件启用针对 CVE-2012-1535 的入侵检测规则。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-08/msg00010.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-08/msg00012.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=139455789818399&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1203.html","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201209-01.xml","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-18.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-1535","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20624","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-1535.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1535.json","https://github.com/EmergingThreats/et-luajit-scripts/blob/109d050f5593e629311d0ca92d3200f59d57a7c8/CVE-2012-1535.lua"