6Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS12-060 (KB2720573) 提供的安全更新。受影响产品对应补丁：Office 2003 SP3 安装 KB2726929，Office 2007 SP2/SP3 安装 KB2687441，Office 2010 SP1 (32位) 安装 KB2597986，SQL Server 2000 SP4 安装 KB983812 (GDR) 或 KB983811 (QFE)，SQL Server 2005 SP4 安装 KB2726929，SQL Server 2008/2008 R2 安装 KB2687441，Visual Basic 6.0 Runtime 安装 KB2708437。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。如无法立即打补丁，可通过注册表设置 TabStrip ActiveX 控件 kill bit（CLSID: {1EFB6596-857C-11D1-B16A-00C0F0283628}）或在 Office 中禁用所有 ActiveX 控件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/54948","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-227A.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2012/ms12-060","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15447","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-1856","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-1856.md","https://github.com/houjingyi233/office-exploit-case-study/blob/09de49e31b83b4348c9e892bfde1ef1f597bc38a/CVE-2012-0158&CVE-2012-1856/CVE-2012-1856/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/SSVC/data/2012/CVE-2012-1856.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1856","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CVE-2012-1856-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/decalage2/oletools/blob/ec10260989dbc48b9109e3d05d22beee19cf2333/oletools/common/clsid.py","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2012/CVE-2012-1856/README_KO.md","https://github.com/rapid7/dap/blob/38bd19d0906183aaa896b55fa3ab756a6254da84/data/vulndb.rb","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-1856.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2012-1856.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0111.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2012/EXP-AVE-2012-0111.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0010","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1835","title":"Timely All-in-One Event Calendar 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 All-in-One Event Calendar 插件 1.4 及 1.5 版本中存在多处反射型跨站脚本漏洞。由于多个参数（包括 title、args、before_title、after_title、button_value 及 msg）在输出前未进行充分的过滤与转义处理，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 URL 诱使用户点击，从而在用户浏览器中执行任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 代码。该漏洞影响使用该插件的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1835"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-08-14T21:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:23Z","remediation":"升级 All-in-One Event Calendar 插件至 1.6 及以上版本，该版本已修复了对 title、msg、args、button_value 等参数的输入过滤缺陷。如无法升级，可在 WordPress 后台停用该插件，并通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）对查询参数中 <script> 等关键字进行拦截作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2012-04/0071.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52986","https://www.htbridge.com/advisory/HTB23082","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37077","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-1835.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2012/CVE-2012-1835.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-1835.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-18